@url = http://localhost:3000

### Crear alumno
POST {{url}}/api/alumnos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Jorge Quinteros",
  "notas": [6, 7, 9]
}

### crear y duplicar "error"
POST {{url}}/api/alumnos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Jorge Quinteros",
  "notas": [5, 7, 4]
}

### get datos alumnos
GET {{url}}/api/alumnos

### get alumno puntual
GET {{url}}/api/alumnos/1

### Actualizar "error"
PUT {{url}}/api/alumnos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notas": [8, 7, 10]
}

### Buscar
GET {{url}}/api/alumnos/nombre/Jorge

### Eliminar
DELETE {{url}}/api/alumnos/1